/webp\u0022 width=\u0022800\u0022/\u003E\n\u003Cimg alt=\u0022Image of deep space showing far away stars and planets in the distance\u0022 class=\u0022lazyload\u0022 data-srcset=\u0022https://eurn-cdn-endpoint-10-10-d2agf5gpbxa5gkge.z02.azurefd.net/34be0bae2605/media/sxddzyvn/space-7273891_1280.jpg?width=800\u0026amp;height=600\u0026amp;v=1dc07768a241c70\u0026amp;format=webp\u0026amp;quality=75 1x, https://eurn-cdn-endpoint-10-10-d2agf5gpbxa5gkge.z02.azurefd.net/34be0bae2605/media/sxddzyvn/space-7273891_1280.jpg?width=1600\u0026amp;height=1200\u0026amp;v=1dc07768a241c70\u0026amp;format=webp\u0026amp;quality=75 2x\u0022 height=\u0022600\u0022 src=\u0022https://eurn-cdn-endpoint-10-10-d2agf5gpbxa5gkge.z02.azurefd.net/34be0bae2605/media/sxddzyvn/space-7273891_1280.jpg?width=160\u0026amp;height=120\u0026amp;v=1dc07768a241c70\u0026amp;format=webp\u0026amp;quality=75\u0022 width=\u0022800\u0022/\u003E\n\u003C/picture\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022info\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\u0022heading md base-heading\u0022\u003EOur top ten articles on digital customer experience and website management from 2025\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022text base-text\u0022\u003E\u003Cp\u003EIn 2025 we published over twenty articles on the 3chillies blog exploring tips, trends, updates, and issues form the world of digital customer experience and website management. \u00A0In our traditional end-of-year-round-up we explore our ten most popular blog posts from 2025.\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/a\u003E\n\u003C!-- Meta --\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022meta base-text\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\u0022date\u0022\u003E\u003Ctime\u003E05 Jan 2026\u003C/time\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022categories base-text\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\n\u003Ca href=\u0022/3chillies-blog/accessibility/\u0022 rel=\u0022NOINDEX, FOLLOW\u0022 title=\u0022Accessibility\u0022\u003EAccessibility\u003C/a\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\n\u003